<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>AI &amp; Agent 开发者晨报</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>每日 AI 领域精选新闻与深度分析</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 06:31:06 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/web/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>Gemini 3.7 Flash 发布，编码能力提升且价格比三周前的前代降低50%</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/gemini-3-7-flash-lands-with-coding-gains-and-undercuts-its-three-week-old-predecessors-price-by-50/</link><description>Google发布Gemini 3.7 Flash，距离3.6 Flash仅三周（2026年7月23日），编码能力显著提升，价格降低50%，成为最具性价比的轻量级模型，适合开发集成。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/gemini-3-7-flash-lands-with-coding-gains-and-undercuts-its-three-week-old-predecessors-price-by-50/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 02:41:52 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>Google</category><category>编码</category><category>性价比</category></item><item><title>GPT-5.6 构建者指南发布</title><link>https://openai.com/index/builders-guide-to-gpt-5-6</link><description>OpenAI发布GPT-5.6构建者指南，介绍如何利用新模型构建更快、更经济的AI Agent，涵盖提示优化、工具调用、成本控制等最佳实践，并附初创公司案例。</description><guid>https://openai.com/index/builders-guide-to-gpt-5-6</guid><source>OpenAI</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>OpenAI</category><category>Agent</category><category>最佳实践</category></item><item><title>SpaceXAI 发布 Grok 4.6 和 Grok @Bot</title><link>https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-spacexai-grok-46-and-grok</link><description>SpaceXAI发布Grok 4.6模型及Grok @Bot功能，增强编码Agent能力，突破持续集成限制，可自动处理PR和issue，提升开发工作流自动化水平。</description><guid>https://www.latent.space/p/ainews-spacexai-grok-46-and-grok</guid><source>Latent Space</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 09:53:47 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>SpaceXAI</category><category>编码Agent</category></item><item><title>Writer发布新AI模型并升级成本控制框架</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/13/writer-introduces-new-ai-model-and-upgraded-harness-to-contain-token-costs/</link><description>Writer发布基于Z.ai的GLM-5.2后训练变体的新模型，并升级成本控制框架，通过动态token分配降低推理成本，适合企业大规模部署，性能与GPT-4o相当。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/13/writer-introduces-new-ai-model-and-upgraded-harness-to-contain-token-costs/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 05:13:24 +0800</pubDate><category>大模型</category><category>企业模型</category><category>成本控制</category></item><item><title>Databricks完成50亿美元融资，估值1900亿美元</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/13/databricks-wanted-to-raise-1b-investors-wanted-15b-it-settled-on-5b-at-a-190b-valuation/</link><description>Databricks原计划融资10亿美元，但投资者需求达150亿，最终以1900亿美元估值完成50亿美元融资，资金将用于AI基础设施扩张，包括数据中心和GPU集群。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/13/databricks-wanted-to-raise-1b-investors-wanted-15b-it-settled-on-5b-at-a-190b-valuation/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 04:14:39 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>融资</category><category>AI基础设施</category></item><item><title>OpenAI本周失去第二位高管</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/979815/openai-denise-dresser-leaving-executive-departure</link><description>OpenAI本周（2026年8月10日至16日）第二位高管离职，COO Denise Dresser离开，此前CTO已离职，引发外界对公司领导层稳定性和未来方向的担忧。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/979815/openai-denise-dresser-leaving-executive-departure</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 03:28:39 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>高管变动</category><category>OpenAI</category></item><item><title>50个开源项目教会我们AI时代的安全问题</title><link>https://github.blog/open-source/maintainers/what-50-open-source-projects-taught-us-about-security-in-the-ai-era/</link><description>GitHub博客分析50个开源项目在AI时代面临的安全挑战，包括依赖混淆、模型投毒、供应链攻击，为维护者提供依赖锁定、签名验证等具体防护建议。</description><guid>https://github.blog/open-source/maintainers/what-50-open-source-projects-taught-us-about-security-in-the-ai-era/</guid><source>GitHub Blog</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>开源安全</category><category>供应链</category></item><item><title>组织如何使用AI：来自ChatGPT的证据</title><link>https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/how-organizations-use-chatgpt.pdf</link><description>OpenAI发布报告，分析企业使用ChatGPT的实际模式，包括自动化客服、内容生成、数据分析等，揭示AI采用趋势和生产力提升效果，为开发者提供部署参考。</description><guid>https://cdn.openai.com/pdf/how-organizations-use-chatgpt.pdf</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 03:25:38 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>企业采用</category><category>报告</category></item><item><title>Suno Studio 2.0 新增聊天功能，可与DAW像乐队成员一样对话</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/suno-studio-2-0s-new-chat-feature-lets-you-talk-to-your-daw-like-its-a-bandmate/</link><description>Suno发布Studio 2.0，新增自然语言聊天界面，用户可通过对话控制数字音频工作站，实现实时协作、多轨道编辑，将AI音乐平台升级为完整制作工具。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/suno-studio-2-0s-new-chat-feature-lets-you-talk-to-your-daw-like-its-a-bandmate/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 03:39:54 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>AI音乐</category><category>创作工具</category></item><item><title>微软Copilot的类Clippy虚拟形象Mico退役</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/tech/979871/microsoft-copilot-mico-retired</link><description>微软宣布Copilot的虚拟形象Mico不再作为默认面孔，转向更简洁的交互界面，反映AI助手从拟人化向功能优先的设计理念转变，Mico将迁移至Learn Live平台。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/tech/979871/microsoft-copilot-mico-retired</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 05:42:38 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>Copilot</category><category>设计</category></item><item><title>Phinq：在AI Agent造成破坏前阻止它们</title><link>https://www.producthunt.com/products/phinq</link><description>Phinq是一款AI Agent安全工具，可在Agent执行危险操作前拦截，支持自定义规则、实时监控和API集成，帮助生产环境中的Agent安全运行。</description><guid>https://www.producthunt.com/products/phinq</guid><source>Product Hunt</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 07:43:54 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>安全工具</category><category>拦截</category></item><item><title>在LM Studio中直接从Hugging Face加载模型</title><link>https://dev.to/multigrid/loading-a-model-straight-from-hugging-face-in-lm-studio-3jjj</link><description>教程介绍LM Studio如何以Hugging Face为模型目录直接加载模型，无需单独注册，简化本地模型部署流程，支持一键下载和运行开源模型。</description><guid>https://dev.to/multigrid/loading-a-model-straight-from-hugging-face-in-lm-studio-3jjj</guid><source>DEV.to AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 06:21:29 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>模型部署</category><category>Hugging Face</category></item><item><title>SCoPE：视频扩散Transformer的视线坐标位置编码</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2087941343175750088</link><description>提出SCoPE位置编码，通过引入视线坐标信息提升视频扩散Transformer的时间一致性和运动连贯性，在多个视频生成基准上取得更好效果，代码已开源。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2087941343175750088</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:36:22 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>位置编码</category><category>视频扩散</category></item><item><title>City2Graph：用于异构图神经网络和城市空间分析的Python库</title><link>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1vn8oya/city2graph_a_python_library_for_heterogeneous/</link><description>City2Graph将地理空间数据转化为异构图神经网络可分析的结构，支持城市空间分析、交通预测等任务，提供预处理、建模和可视化工具，降低应用门槛。</description><guid>https://www.reddit.com/r/MachineLearning/comments/1vn8oya/city2graph_a_python_library_for_heterogeneous/</guid><source>Reddit ML</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:59:58 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>图神经网络</category><category>城市计算</category></item><item><title>MiniMax-Music3 Gradio工作流发布</title><link>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2087951732235993488</link><description>MiniMax-Music3的Gradio工作流发布，用户可通过网页界面直接使用音乐生成模型，支持文本到音乐、旋律续写等功能，降低AI音乐创作门槛，无需本地GPU。</description><guid>https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2087951732235993488</guid><source>Twitter @_akhaliq</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 01:17:39 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>音乐生成</category><category>Gradio</category></item><item><title>在家搭建AI：第一部分——一堆废料</title><link>https://jdagostino.github.io/ai-pt1-box-o-scraps/index.html</link><description>教程系列第一部分，指导利用废旧硬件（旧PC、树莓派等）搭建本地AI环境，涵盖硬件选择、操作系统配置、模型部署，适合DIY爱好者和隐私敏感用户。</description><guid>https://jdagostino.github.io/ai-pt1-box-o-scraps/index.html</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:22:05 +0800</pubDate><category>DIY</category><category>本地部署</category></item><item><title>改造预训练语言模型的循环深度：两种参数预算下的安装、外推、迁移与保留</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11233</link><description>该论文提出将循环深度集成到预训练语言模型的方法，在两种参数规模下验证了安装、外推、迁移和保留能力，表明循环结构可有效扩展模型深度而不显著增加参数量。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11233</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>模型架构</category><category>参数效率</category></item><item><title>为什么AI检测在学术诚信中失败</title><link>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11256</link><description>研究揭示商业AI检测工具在区分人类与AI文本时存在系统性偏差，对改写、混合内容等策略鲁棒性差，建议高校谨慎依赖检测结果并探索替代方案。</description><guid>https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.11256</guid><source>ArXiv CL</source><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>AI检测</category><category>学术诚信</category></item><item><title>今日深度分析 - 2026-08-14</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>今日动态显示模型发布密集（Gemini 3.7 Flash、Grok 4.6、Writer新模型），价格战加剧（Gemini降价50%），同时Agent安全工具（Phinq）和开源安全指南受到关注，预示AI开发将更注重成本与安全。高管变动和巨额融资反映行业资本持续涌入，竞争格局加速演变。</description><guid>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/daily-analysis/20260814</guid></item></channel></rss>